WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.810
Shichimiya.

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:07.070
You can't do things like this.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.400
You just can't!

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.580
I have no experience
when it comes to romance...

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.580
...and I have always been dense
when it comes to things like that.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.700
Shichimiya.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.130
As dense as I am, seeing her tears
were enough to make me realize.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.090
I realized what Shichimiya
had been attempting to make war with.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:32.800
Why she asked me those questions,
and why she made me say those things.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.510
The water mage's
attack has intensified.
Rescue requested.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.100
And why she wept.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.770
What are you doing?

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.320
New discovery. I would like to
commence exploration.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:55.410
Forget it. You haven't brought your umbrella.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:57.530
Kuzuha said...

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:59.490
What does Kuzuha have to do with anything?

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:01.290
Just duck under here.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.160
You're freezing.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.460
Dark beings always maintain
a low body temperature.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.610
I'm coming in.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:59.030
I made you some rice gruel. Try to eat some.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:04.700
EPISODE XI BLUE MOON RAGNAROK

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.200
Can you sit up?

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.830
The real world is becoming distorted!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.000
Is it due to the weakened state
of Wicked Lord Shingan?!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.130
Hey, you okay?

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:19.720
You still have a fever.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.100
I want you to stay in bed for another day.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.680
I cannot afford to.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.270
Listen, you have a cold.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.190
Remember how you tried to go out yesterday...

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.310
...and ended up in a sorry heap
just past the door?

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.320
Ugh, the world is banishing me.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:39.740
I am fine now. A night's sleep
has fully restored me.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:42.320
No way. You are grounded until you're all better.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.660
Where are you trying to go anyway?

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.490
That I cannot answer. I have said so before.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.330
I put the question to you as Dark Flame Master!
Where do you go?

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.710
It's not like I'll do anything
with that information, you know.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:02.590
I just don't like you going off somewhere...

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.930
...in secret from me.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.720
Forgive me.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.440
But soon, all will be revealed.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:14.940
Master!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.030
How could you perish this way
and leave me alone?!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.990
It's d-d-death!

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:21.280
She is not dead!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.110
She'll be better soon, right?

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.820
If I were so inclined...

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.580
...I could use the power of Wicked Lord
Shingan to recover. However...

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.540
Gasp! Do you mean that to recover...

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.210
...I must feed you the black dragon
flower that only grows...

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:36.790
...at the summit of the great dark wall
in the Wicked Lord's World?!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.210
Please don't provide her with a scenario.

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.050
Stay back or you'll catch her cold.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.630
Master! I'll be waiting for you!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.930
I swear this to you!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.760
Thank you both, but we can't have you
catching her cold.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.470
That's true.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.390
See you around, Chimera.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.900
Take care of that cold. I'm sure you have stacks
of homework to do.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.980
You spoke what must remain unspoken.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.900
What do you mean?!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.900
Tell them the cat ate your homework.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.450
I want to know about Sophia.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:05.780
Huh?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:10.240
I made several attempts to contact her
through her electro-protocol code...

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.450
...but she has yet to make an appearance.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.170
O-oh, really? I wonder what's wrong?

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.250
She said she was really busy.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.380
He's so transparent.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:23.630
From the moment Shichimiya
said she was going to make war...

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.300
...I thought it might come down to this.

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.850
You're saying you realized?

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.180
It was easy to tell.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.310
All that girl ever looked at was you.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.190
Actually, it was Toka who told us about it.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.360
So? What are you gonna do about it?

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:40.820
Do about it?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.940
You can't just leave her like that.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.610
That girl is in love with you.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:49.160
How am I supposed to know what to do?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.830
I never even had a girlfriend before now.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.370
MYSTERY JEWEL 298 YEN

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.540
Don't get defiant with me.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.750
I'm just being honest. What should I do?

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.580
Pardon?

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.960
Aren't women supposed to know
about this sort of thing?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.010
H-how am I supposed to know?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:06.680
Chicken.

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:08.680
I'm not chickening out.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.600
Then stay out of it.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:13.680
You're always such a busybody,
like that time with Rikka.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:17.480
I help you guys out when you need it!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.400
I never asked for your help.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.530
Do what you want. See if I care!

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:24.820
Kumin-senpai, let's go.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.400
What?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.750
What?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.000
Ow!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.500
What the hell?!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.500
It's nothing!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.420
Don't knock people over for nothing!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:42.920
It's nothing, but it's also something!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.630
Who do you think you are? Dekomori?!
It's nothing, but it's also something!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.970
What?

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.550
Shichimiya!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.010
Hero!

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.060
What is she doing?

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:57.980
Whoa, hey!

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:00.980
I have returned!

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.520
What do you think you're doing?
You could have died!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:06.400
Ripples and magical energy were vital...

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.990
...to conquer the inner me!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.280
I get it!

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.490
Please don't accept that.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.790
Thanks to that, I've conquered it for good!

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.450
I am 100% victorious! From now on...

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:21.710
...I am magical devil girl
"Spin-off Revision Plus Alpha!"

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:24.960
It sounds like a game that's being
gradually ruined by sequels.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:31.340
That's why you can permanently delete
what happened earlier! Let it disappear!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.560
Shichimiya, will that do it?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.480
Yup! That'll do it!

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.900
That's a relief.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.400
Oh! Angel detected!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.700
Togashi.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.530
What?

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.740
Did you take what she just said seriously...?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:58.040
...thinking, "That's good.
She looks like she's coping fine"?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.710
You mean she isn't?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.000
What the...?!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.460
Why would she be fine?! She's acting tough!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.130
How am I supposed to see that?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.420
Just look at her!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.670
I've hung out with her enough
to know how she works!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.260
Then what do you expect from me?!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.050
Well...

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.720
Do you know how they say
that love is like a dream?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:21.350
With a dream, you eventually wake up from it.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:25.020
It's hard to force yourself to wake up.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.240
Kumin-senpai.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.530
Where are you going?

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.990
Who cares? You're not my keeper.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:38.540
What's with her?

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.700
Morisummer loves you.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.500
What?

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.290
She loves Rikka, and Dekomori...

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.290
...you, and Shichimiya so much...

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.880
She loves chunibyo.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:53.430
I'm a bit jealous of you guys.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.100
I wish I could have chunibyo too.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.050
You do?

00:08:57.350 --> 00:09:00.640
Then I could feel the same way as all of you.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.440
But I doubt that's how you get chunibyo.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.690
The fact that you admire it means that
you have a good case of chunibyo.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.900
You think so?

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.950
Aren't you Wicked Lord Shingan
the Second, Kumin-senpai?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.830
YOU'VE GOT MAIL

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.760
Morisummer!

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:34.840
Sophia, you appear to have lost your way.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.800
What brings you here?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.600
Did you regain your memory?!

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:41.930
Wanna eat some medicinal plants?

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.100
I do not!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:48.440
I expressly came wearing this uniform,
hoping it would make it easier to communicate.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.940
It's a tight fit.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.190
Huh?

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:54.030
Ahem. Sophia.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.570
I have words for you.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.200
The words of the magician Morisummer.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:03.040
Morisummer once fought someone
who stole her identity...

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.960
...and punished this person.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:07.500
That is when she made a realization.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:12.800
She realized how one might face and fight
one's other inner self face-to-face.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.300
One's other inner self?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:19.850
Yes. You must look outwards to know thyself.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.930
Just as I found myself
when I fought my imposter...

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:27.390
I am certain that you, too,
have an opponent to face.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.100
Find that opponent.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:30.940
Morisummer.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.610
Then your path will open before you.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.610
Thank you.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:40.320
What a total pain. Message received?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.280
Morisummer! Thank you.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.330
I'll give you a supply of magical energy!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.330
You're too close! Stop that.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.710
It's you!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:51.210
Hey, Mjolnir Hammer! Come over here!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:54.170
Was Dark Flame Master not enough for you?!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:57.300
Do you dare mess with
Fake Mori Summer as well?!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.760
Unforgivable!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.640
How do you feel?

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.140
Kuzuha, is the moon out?

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:13.020
It's a lovely full moon.
It's going to be a blue moon tonight.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.030
A blue moon.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:20.030
Shichimiya is in love with me, but I love Rikka.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.780
Forget it. It's too complex. What should I do?

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:27.960
Shichimiya.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.460
Hero. Or rather Dark Flame Master!

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.000
Wanna see my magic?

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.430
Shichimiya.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.520
I've been looking everywhere...

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:52.150
...but you are the only suitable
opponent for me to fight, Hero.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.900
This is the only way to settle the score.
Which means...

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.240
This is war!

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.240
But you're...

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:02.240
Here I come! Devil Lord, recognized!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.740
Big Brother. Oh, Satone?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.870
Uh, yeah.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.120
Big Brother, Rikka is gone!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:08.580
What?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.040
I only looked away for a moment.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.540
Why that...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.000
What do we do?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.000
Shichimiya.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.840
There's a blue moon out tonight.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.180
Yeah.

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:25.800
I think she probably realized
that there's a blue moon out tonight.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:27.600
Blue moon?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.850
You really don't remember?

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.860
This is it!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.700
Dark Flame Dragon?

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:46.240
Hero, you're the one who said that
the Dark Flame Dragon...

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:49.040
...sleeping within you would come back to life.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:50.960
You said you wanted it brought back to life.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:57.880
To whom I am bound by the absolute contract,
unchanged from long ago and for all eternity.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.840
Even if I should travel through
time and dimensions...

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.180
...past the reaches of the parallel world...

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:05.300
...our contract shall continue to be binding...

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.430
...and by its absolute power,
you will appear before me.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.890
At this very moment, in this world of chaos...

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.140
A world I was born into by mistake...

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:16.730
...I am now attempting to use
its powers of containment...

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:20.440
...and memory falsification,
to rob myself of my true memories.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:25.070
I fear that in the not too distant future,
I will pass into nothingness.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.080
I hereby entrust thee...

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.620
...with the Dark Flame Dragon
that dwells within me.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:33.710
With the power of its form,
which can plunge this world into shadow.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:36.250
With the power to consume
this fallacious world...

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.840
...to revolutionize and remold it.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.590
Three keys are needed to revive
the Dark Flame Dragon.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:47.760
Skuld.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.640
Belldandy.

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.310
And Urd.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.560
You, to whom I am bound by
the absolute contract.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:59.320
If you indeed hold the power
to share my destiny...

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:02.190
...surely you can assemble
these three keys effortlessly.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.700
You, to whom I am bound for eternity.
I will enter a period of slumber...

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.620
...to await that appointed time.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.280
I want you to endow me with power...

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.540
...on a future night of the blue moon.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.710
Is this where it's hidden?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.880
I only half-remember it,
but it has to be around here.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.010
I have to dig here.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.060
What's this?

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.520
The Wicked Lord Shingan left this here.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:39.900
I think these are markers to
show this has already been searched.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.400
No way.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.240
You mean...?

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:45.990
I also searched for them.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.240
I just couldn't find Urd.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.200
The key you sent into the past.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.500
The only way to send a key into the past
is to utilize the parallel world.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.370
According to your memo,
the entrance to the parallel world...

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.340
...is in the shadow cast by the 14th pylon.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:04.510
But I didn't know which pylon
to start counting from.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.130
So, she went through each and every one?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:20.650
Forgive me. But soon, all will be revealed.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.940
All this time, she's been doing it for that?

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.530
Do you know where it is?

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.450
Yeah, but just vaguely!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.740
I remember this street!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.040
This way!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.540
Rikka.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.800
No matter how serious you were about chunibyo.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.550
No matter how serious you were about love...

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.470
...you always put me first.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:56.720
Rikka! Rikka! Rikka!

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:59.230
Hero.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.690
Rikka!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.570
Yuta.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:15.240
What are you doing?!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.290
Yuta, is this it?

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:27.250
Urd?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.300
You idiot!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:31.300
You went out looking for this
while you're sick with a cold?!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.510
Do you want to make it worse?!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.560
But it said the one you are bound to...

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:39.430
...by the absolute, eternal contract
could bring it back to life.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.730
That's no reason.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:43.940
I am bound to you for eternity.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.900
I have to find it.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.230
I have to find it, and prove it!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.660
Yuta?

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:57.450
What're you doing? You don't have to do all that!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:01.330
But I'm supposed to be bound to you...

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.620
...but I didn't have a single key.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:07.090
But Sophia did, so I had to...

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.550
I can't breathe.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.380
Yuta?

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:18.810
Yuta, are you bound to me?

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.180
Yes, we are bound together
by the absolute contract.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:35.740
I broke a bone in my
second summer of middle school.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.370
So, I went and buried it inside the cast.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.620
I'm amazed at all the effort
I went through back then.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.710
Here.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:53.920
That's incredible!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:57.220
Nobody could tell where it is from that clue.

00:17:57.640 --> 00:18:00.470
It was so hard to bury it in metal
that I gave up halfway.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:07.310
I guess things really do stay
untouched after so many years.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.860
It's just a rock.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:15.200
That is the enchanted stone that
will summon the Dark Flame Dragon.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.320
Sorta.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.070
The blue moon.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:21.330
I researched back then to find out
there'd be a blue moon tonight.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.460
Rikka. Or rather...

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.460
...please do this, Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.130
You, to whom I am bound for eternity!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.010
Be destroyed, real.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.300
Blow up, synapses.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.800
Vanishment...

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.010
...This World!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:06.660
Incredible.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.170
Hero!

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:11.750
Or rather, Ghelzonianses! This is war!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.380
Let me do combat with the
Dark Flame Dragon at full power!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.710
What?

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.680
I finally realized which opponent I must fight.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.760
My true enemy I must fight...

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:25.520
...is the Dark Flame Dragon
I loved, pursued, and gave up with you!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.190
That is the enemy with whom I must fight!

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.400
That is the opponent with whom
I must settle my score!

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.190
Shichimiya. I understand.

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:36.990
I am Ghelzonianses!

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.490
I am the one who will destroy
the entire world and give it new form!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.780
Magical devil girl!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.330
You wish to retain your magic for eternity!

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:47.960
Observe the power of my Dark Flame Dragon...

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.960
...with your own two eyes!

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.170
I couldn't ask for more!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.730
The Dark Flame Dragon never actually existed.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.910
So it could never actually be seen.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.830
However...

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.340
Wh-what is that?!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.840
However...

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:45.220
Rikka's cold came back with a vengeance
and knocked her down.

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:50.140
Yuta, I am going back in time to July 20th.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:51.270
Impossible!

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.900
With a catastrophic amount
of homework still looming...

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.110
...summer vacation came to an end.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.230
What? Really?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.650
I've got too much homework.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.530
You'll miss Yumeha growing up.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.070
I'm gonna transform!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:08.290
I was unable to go visit them
in Jakarta as I was told to.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.040
And then...

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.330
How are you handling your homework?

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:17.960
No problem is too great
for the born-again Sophia!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.920
Shichimiya concluded her battle
with the Dark Flame Dragon...

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.180
...and successfully
evolved into a new Shichimiya.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.470
So, what exactly has changed about you?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.970
I never change.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.390
I am a magical devil girl, for all eternity.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:34.480
In order to stay unchanged,
I needed a powerful life-changing battle...

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:38.480
...to destroy the stress I had built up
in the name of staying unchanged.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:43.530
What's that supposed to mean? Wait...

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.410
Is that the natural logic of the world?

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:50.240
That's it. It's the natural logic of the world.

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:54.620
Going out to look for angels again?

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.500
Yeah. Say, Hero?

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.380
Bye-bye.

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:05.970
TO BE CONTINUED
